## Description
Slice 2: the data layer and authentication. **Stacked on #1** (base is `feature/scaffold`).

## Changes
- Prisma 6 schema + init migration + grounded seed (User, Profile, Update, Reaction, WaitlistEntry, ContributorInterest)
- Auth.js (NextAuth v5) Credentials provider; JWT sessions carry `id` + `role`
- argon2id password hashing (`@node-rs/argon2`)
- Signup (with role selection) + login + sign-out
- `/app` auth boundary via a server-component layout — no Edge middleware, keeps Prisma in the Node runtime
- Zod validation; server actions for signup/login
- CI: Postgres service + `prisma generate/migrate/seed` for the e2e job

