## Notes
- **Prisma pinned to 6.x on purpose:** Prisma 7 replaced the classic `url`-in-schema + `new PrismaClient()` model with a new config-file + driver-adapter architecture — added complexity for no benefit here.
- Email verification intentionally deferred (accounts usable immediately) per the spec.
- Seed runs via `tsx` so it works across Node 20/22/24/26 and the Docker migrate step.
- GitHub retargets this PR's base to `dev` once #1 merges. Please review — no auto-merge.

